2eb75bb73d61fa9144704ea6"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best games I've played in a while. Some secrets are so obtuse that you will probably be required to look them up, but the customization for how you want to play your character, and the many great boss fights, are what set this game out from other PvE shooters.", "timestamp_created": 1694128894, "timestamp_updated": 1694128894, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "145881359", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993762900", "personaname": "RockandGrohl", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RockandGrohl/", "num_games_owned": 182, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 4545, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4220, "last_played": 1694298453, "avatar": "e892cbee7cb0ff9428d3c863e9d8ac96c3c04c03"}, "language": "english", "review": "First souls-like game, what a blast. AA game but really outshines some AAA crap that's come out recently. Heavily recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1694128672, "timestamp_updated": 1694128672, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "145881325", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060470937", "personaname": "Dyztanz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198060470937/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 2002, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2002, "last_played": 1692656012, "avatar": "edc6dc18291998ae00cf501fca643ca6a77358e9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yup\n-It's a good game.  \n-Solid shooting mechanics/difficulty.\n-Graphics are nice. \n-few bugs.\n-tons of secrets to discover.\n-New class system has promise, but needs some dedicated tweaking.\nNope\n-I miss the leveling system from the first one.  Without kill xp to level traits, it encourages players to try avoiding enemies rather than fighting.\n-I think there needs to be more diversity in the monsters. With the same mobs throughout the world, you run into the same fight over and over.  Just bring back some of the enemies from the first one (remnants of the root still fighting for power).\n-some of the secrets are just beyond what most players are willing to do to get.  The secrets are hidden behind a ton of steps.\n\nOverall a great game with few flaws to pull down an otherwise excellent experience!\nBuy it.\n\nP.S. If you spell out the art director's middle name with the cranial implants (only available on NG+9) in the first dungeon on the left in the future world (unless your character is female in which case you have to do it in the labyrinth next to the glitching portal) you will open a new gate to a secret biome filled with deadly cows.", "timestamp_created": 1694128615, "timestamp_updated": 1694128615, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "145880607", "author": {"steamid": "76561198363006562", "personaname": "Rihan Nura", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198363006562/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1347, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1022, "last_played": 1721192228, "avatar": "c2926e2540d1aef2fce03480e9c73d23231